{"cluster_id": "C-3468", "topic": "storage layout", "target": "architecture/storage-layout", "member_ids": ["B040-155", "B040-158", "B040-186"], "canonical_claim": "v3 has no writer_version or format_version; forensic provenance is carried by ch and bld where needed, while currentCompatibilityVersion and changePoints remain stamping machinery; v3 separates Control JSON objects, sorted NDJSON record streams, and Payload hybrid objects; namespace verbatim files and mountpoint objects remain raw non-family passthroughs; v3 targets three families plus explicit raw passthrough, zero unversioned objects, one version field gated on line 1, and removal of protobuf and code generation from the subsystem", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/cas/codecs_proposal_v3.md#families-by-role", "docs/superpowers/cas/codecs_proposal_v3.md#one-file-shape", "docs/superpowers/cas/codecs_proposal_v3.md#what-this-buys-concretely"]}
